      "writtenOn": "2023-05-11T17:59:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we shouldn\u0027t because it requires creating more modules than it should. `aidl_library` is provided to support strip import prefix and including aidl headers. Those aidl files without strip import prefix or aidl headers can be passed in via `srcs` prop.\n\nLet me know if you have any objection here.",
      "parentUuid": "ae20adb0_e0f54121",
