      "writtenOn": "2023-05-08T21:40:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "instead of appending aidl srcs here, should we instead allow the libraryinfo to be used in the gen.go code.\n\nThis would prevent the checking if an include dir already exists in the gen.go code and make it easier to make the changes necessary to sandbox if you\u0027re depending on an aidl_library.",
